    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        292,
        2324,
        1544,
        2517
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Under the terms of the agreed policy the costs of management, relocation (other than bonuses, relocation allowances and finders' fees) and demolition will be charged to Gross Project Costs and borne by the Federal, State and City Governments. Since this will eliminate these costs from",
